# pyenv
#   For a library or package, you might want to share your .python-version.
#   For an app, this is usually fine to ignore.
# .python-version

# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in version control.
#   However, in case of collaboration, if used with a venv it can be ignored.
# Pipfile.lock

# poetry
#   Using Poetry, it's common to check in poetry.lock
# poetry.lock

# pdm
#   Using PDM, it's common to check in pdm.lock
# pdm.lock

